Electron adaptation notes (44-x-y):
features.cc/.h: kEnforceIsolatedWorldOriginLock is declared at the end of
the namespace because the neighbouring main-branch features
(kSafeRevalidation, kBindURLLoaderFactoryToHighPriorityTaskRunner) do not
exist on this branch. Test-only changes to
cors_url_loader_factory_unittest.cc and cors_url_loader_unittest.cc were
dropped after context conflicts (Electron does not build them); the
cors_url_loader_test_util.* changes are kept.

